# SSE fixtures are byte-exact captures of provider wire traffic, replayed by
# format-translation.test.ts. The SSE event separator is a blank line: the test
# harness splits on "\n\n". Under core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default) these
# files check out as CRLF, "\n\n" never matches "\r\n\r\n", and 12 tests fail
# with an empty parse — indistinguishable from a real anthropic-sse regression.
# Keep them LF on every platform.
*.sse text eol=lf
